+   `R` is nonmonomial, `st(R)=(a,b)` with `a,b>0`, and
+   `sigma>l*rho>0`. Its minimum-gamma endpoint has positive pi-degree. The
+   preceding positivity (or Astra's pole lemma) makes `E` polynomial, and
