+## Hostile gate: monomial-J Euler support
+
+Let `l=k+1`, with `P,Q in K[gamma,pi]`, characteristic zero,
+`[P,Q]=c gamma^k`, `c!=0`, and let `(rho,sigma)` be primitive with both entries
+positive.
