+   `t=gamma^l`, `Pbar,Qbar in K[t^(1/l),pi] subset L^(l)` and
+   `[Pbar,Qbar]=c/l`. The GGV direction is the primitive reduction of
+   `(l*rho,sigma)`; Astra omitted this harmless gcd normalization. Positivity
